      "description": "Fraction of Worker capacity in use. At 100% with LOW host CPU, raise MaxConcurrentActivityExecutionSize \u2014 do not add Workers. At 100% with HIGH host CPU, add Workers.\n\nThat discriminator is host CPU, which is NOT a Temporal metric: you need node_exporter or cAdvisor alongside this or the two cases are indistinguishable.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
