      "description": "Share of Tasks handed straight to a waiting Worker instead of being written to the datastore first. High is good and cheap; a fall means Workers were not ready when work arrived.\n\nNear-zero on an IDLE queue is meaningless, not bad \u2014 the ratio needs real poll traffic to mean anything.",
